{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act25side_level_act25side_st04",
  "groupId": "act25side",
  "stageId": "act25side_st04",
  "title": "推開未來之門",
  "storyCode": "CW-ST-4",
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act25side/level_act25side_st04.txt",
  "sourceHash": "25316a83013726cf2bbb172989d2e0862fc951a60a6ea6dded4bbf1b95bbcfee",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布萊克",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布萊克",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我聽說過特區監獄的章程，這裡不允許使用尖銳物品，包括筆。你在違反規定。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "也不允許戴墨鏡，布萊克。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在我們被關在一起的第一天，我告訴過你，別打擾我，我有很重要的工作要做，你在前些日子裡一直做得很好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我很希望你能繼續保持。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布萊克",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "該死，稿紙又用完了......背面這些還能寫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "布萊克，幫我個忙，找典獄長再要些稿紙，哥倫比亞的學界會感謝你的貢獻。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布萊克",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你究竟在幹什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布萊克",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你不會覺得我們能活下來吧，斐爾迪南。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布萊克",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哥倫比亞的法律從不心慈手軟，你就不能安靜地等著我們的終點來臨嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布萊克",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果你真的想忙活，想想自己的臨終菜單不好嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你浪費了我兩分鐘時間，布萊克。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我剛剛推論到哪一步了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布萊克",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "臨終菜單。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你覺得你很幽默，嗯？你根本不明白我現在的工作多麼有意義。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在往後的一百年裡，每一個妄圖涉足高能物理領域的研究者，都必須要銘記我的這些理論。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他們會讚頌我的名字，視我如國王，視我如先知。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "死，死又算什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "等著吧，等著吧，克麗斯騰，你以為你很了不起？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是斐爾迪南·克魯尼把這些真理帶回了大地，蠢貨！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小賈斯汀",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "先生，我很高興看到您現在這麼健康。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "監獄負責人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "當然，當然，這都多虧了您。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "監獄負責人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "前些日子，聽說特里蒙有一些不好的傳言......不過，現在這些都過去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小賈斯汀",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "感謝我們的哥倫比亞擁有很多像您這樣傑出的執法者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小賈斯汀",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "聽說您要高升了。州檢察官這個職位，對於您可稱得上是相得益彰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "監獄負責人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "與您的生意相比，實在是算不得什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "監獄負責人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "萊茵生命擴大了在技術方面的投資，購入了十數家各個領域的小型實驗室......哈哈哈，放在以前，我是一點都不關心這些金融新聞的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "監獄負責人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不過，有了小賈斯汀先生您這樣的朋友，我也不能再像以前那樣，只是每天盯著這些鑄鐵欄杆發呆了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小賈斯汀",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我會向您推薦好的投資項目的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小賈斯汀",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我很高興看到，您願意把握住自己的命運。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小賈斯汀",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不過，我這次來還是有些正事的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "監獄負責人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那兩個人？上面已經通知過我了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "監獄負責人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "請便吧，小賈斯汀先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "監獄負責人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "一如既往，合作愉快。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小賈斯汀",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "合作愉快。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "監獄負責人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "多問一句，您要帶走的，究竟是哪一個？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小賈斯汀",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "和以往一樣，瘋子和怪胎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你也來了啊，娜斯提。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜斯提",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "以已經解散的總轄構件科的名義發出臨時會議通知......才過去半個月的時間，就有人要重整萊茵生命？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不止是萊茵生命哦，沃爾沃特科欽斯基、沙灘傘......這座城市最頂尖的科技公司都收到了參會通知，而且派出了代表。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你猜到底是誰組織的這場會議？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜斯提",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "待會自然就知道了......別把頭靠過來，我不想肩膀被弄濕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "娜斯提微微皺了下眉頭，她腰間枯枝狀的裝置突然伸長了一節，觸碰到繆爾賽思的瞬間，對方消失在了視野裡，像是戳破了一個氣泡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜斯提",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "又有了力氣耍弄這套小把戲，看來你恢復得很快，繆爾賽思。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "缺水對我來說，不算多麼嚴重的病吧，治療自然也不難。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜斯提",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我是指你的精神狀態。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜斯提",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我以為你會被打擊得一蹶不振，哭著躲到某個森林裡去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......有位朋友開導了我。他跟我說，“生命在消逝前經歷的一切，都會有意義留存。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜斯提",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你還是那麼情緒化，需要人哄。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不，娜斯提。我只是冷靜下來，想通了一些被我忽略的東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "今天能出現在這裡，出現在你身邊的，自然是萊茵生命生態科的主任，萊茵生命最年輕最權威的生態學專家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜斯提",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "什麼意思？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "克麗斯騰向我轉交了萬星園中微型生態園的生物數據......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "七百五十三種植物可能無一存活，但在此之前，它們依然緊挨著阻隔層生長了足夠長的時間，甚至在突破星莢後也沒有馬上全部死去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那已經是泰拉人未曾設想過的生命可以涉足的高度。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......這是多麼令人欣喜的實驗結果。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "娜斯提，我知道你的夢想是什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜斯提",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜斯提",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（薩卡茲語）天空，亦是薩卡茲的應許之地。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你應該收集了這次萬星園升空後的全過程資料吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜斯提",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯......那天我站得足夠近。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜斯提",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那些能量濺射的煙火，像極了未來齒輪轉動時的火星。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "也就是說，那些資料足夠支援你投入更多、更大、更穩定的空中平台的研究了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "還是說，你已經開始了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜斯提",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......那是，一個城市的雛形。從來沒人說過移動城市......只能在地上匍匐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "而我，可以讓這座城市充滿生機。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "現在，我們的目標一致了。用你的話說，我們是“同行者”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "走吧，會議快開始了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "防衛科成員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......奧利維亞·赫默，認證通過，請通行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "防衛科成員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "塞雷婭主......認證通過，請通行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "赫默和塞雷婭一前一後，穿過漫長的走廊，誰都沒有開口說話，沉默籠罩了兩個人。\n她們停在了會議室的門口。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "塞雷婭，想問什麼就直接問吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你真的準備好了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你養傷的這段時間，我以為你已經想得足夠清楚了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "科學是為了改造社會而存在的，我並不懷疑這一點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我同樣肯定總轄行為的意義，沒有一位科研工作者不會被那片撕裂的天空所震撼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但我們所面臨的真正問題是——然後呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "天空被撕開一角，真相呈現在了所有人面前，我們沒有理由忽視它。但即使所有人都抬起了頭，也不意味著腳下的問題就會消失不見。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "對於科學而言，現有認知體系被顛覆的那一刻，前進的腳步不會因此中斷，反而會加速。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "無數的構建宣告失敗，但新的狂想應運而生。科學家們會迫不及待地撕下天空中的每一片雲，而忙碌生活的普通人始終在被雨淋濕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“現實就是這樣，我們只能接受它”“追求夢想的道路上總是會有所犧牲”......類似的話我們聽得足夠多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒有什麼現實是無法改變的，沒有什麼犧牲是理所應當的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果大部分人只能被迫在夢想與現實間做個選擇，那麼，我必須成為夢想與現實之間的橋樑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "倫理審查、資金管理、項目評估......我會拉緊秩序的韁繩，我會以種種在科學家們看來迂腐而笨重的手段去限制他們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我會成為他們前進路上的監視器、緩衝帶、道岔......總之是夠格的“惡人”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我會讓科學真切地看向每一個人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "赫默，我不知道你是如何取得了足以改變整個特里蒙科技界的力量支持，但你應該知道......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "無論是政府勢力，還是梅蘭德，他們選擇你，並不是因為你的這些憂戚，和一腔熱忱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我知道，但如果目標是一致的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我願意接受。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "赫默握住了門把手。\n她突然停住了，轉頭看向塞雷婭。\n目光灼人，一瞬間塞雷婭差點想要回避。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "塞雷婭，你難道忘了，這正是你以前想要去做的事情？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果你變得猶豫，如果你已經放棄......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那麼我會去做。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "幾十道目光投注在了自己身上。說實話，這種被所有人關注的感覺並不怎麼好受。\n赫默深吸了一口氣，逐一回應那些或驚訝、或錯愕、或嘲弄的眼神。\n良久，她邁步進門。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "各位好，我的名字是奧利維亞·赫默，《特里蒙科學倫理聯合宣言》的發起人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "今天，我站在這裡，是為了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "感謝您，議長先生......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不不不，當年我只是在藍卡塢為潘妮小姐提供了一個試鏡機會，比起您這次幫上的忙，實在是不值一提......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......是的，那孩子估計快被各個公司代表們的口水淹沒了。希望她能應付得來那樣的局面，畢竟，這會是她日後生活的常態。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這樣的擔心確實是多餘的，孩子們總是不乏勇氣，總是跑得很快，我們能做的也只是陪她們走這麼一段路......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈哈，您說得沒錯，我變成了愛操心的老婦人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......下個月的高爾夫球會嗎？抱歉，這次我可能沒法陪您了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是的，議長先生，我已經沒有什麼理由再留在萊茵生命了，況且，我早就到了退休的年齡......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......這應該是很長的一段休假之旅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "司機",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "雅拉女士，實在抱歉，我確實是開錯了路。剛剛問了附近的居民，我們現在轉向，估計還能來得及開到最近的移動城市落腳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不了，就往前開吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "司機",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "司機",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這樣會耽誤您定好的行程。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我剛剛翻了翻車上的地理雜誌，再往前走十幾公里，應該有一個酒莊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "雜誌上說那裡的葡萄酒口感極佳。酒莊堅持只向特定的管道商限量供應，數十年沒有擴大葡萄園的種植規模......我有些好奇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "司機",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "因為萊茵生命那件事，感覺特里蒙城裡那些人最近都急沖沖的，我還以為您是想盡快離開......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒人會為難一個退休的人......再說，旅途的風景多好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "風從很遠的地方吹來，雅拉扶了扶眼鏡，抬頭看向天空。\n雲走得很快，一顆星星隱隱出現在暮色裡。天空高遠，一如往常。\n良久，她輕輕地擺了擺手。司機以為她是在招呼自己，連忙為她打開了車門。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......遠行順利。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "走吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電子音",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "萬星園服務艙，關閉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電子音",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "萬星園觀測廊橋，關閉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電子音",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "萬星園生態區，關閉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克麗斯騰",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "5天8小時43分——泰拉計時方式，突破阻隔層後，萬星園已經堅持了超乎我想像的時間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克麗斯騰",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "再過不久，這些凝聚了目前泰拉最頂尖科學技術的艙室就將化作塵埃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克麗斯騰",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "萬星園原本就不具備星際航行所需要的各項技術與條件，我還記得把娜斯提的設計交給弗里斯頓時他的嗤之以鼻。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克麗斯騰",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "接下來，我將躺入洛肯研製的維生休眠艙，地面上無法模擬真實的地外環境，因此我不確定自己能存活多久。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克麗斯騰",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電子音",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "萬星園星象間關閉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電子音",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "萬星園全域已關閉。維生休眠艙將於五分鐘後啟動，請就位。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克麗斯騰",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克麗斯騰",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“宇宙”——第一次從弗里斯頓那裡瞭解到這個概念時，我無法想像到它所涵蓋的，是如此浩瀚、宏偉、美麗而動人的景象。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克麗斯騰",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......它超越了我們的視界，超越了我們建構在已知之上的貧瘠的想像力，非語言所能準確描述。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克麗斯騰",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可惜我只能錄下這段語音作為資料留存。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克麗斯騰",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "從我這裡看去，已經難辨色彩的無垠天幕之下，我們的“泰拉”被星塵包圍，它沒有支點、沒有繩索，它孤獨且自然地轉動著。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克麗斯騰",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "群星渾然一體，任何關於距離、大小、形狀的度量都是無意義的，“宇宙”深邃得令人失語，令人......深感敬畏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克麗斯騰",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "僅靠肉眼觀測，群星與泰拉等似，那些曾在我們眼中不過點綴了夜空的星辰，是與我們同樣的存在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克麗斯騰",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "或許它們上面也有生命存在，那些同樣熾烈的愛恨、可怖的災難、偉人的宏圖與浪漫、凡俗的掙扎與堅守，也在反反覆覆地上演。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克麗斯騰",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "文明的創造與毀滅寫就它們的歷史，無數壯美的奇蹟、閃耀的名字、臃腫的頭銜添作其中的註腳，而後歸於塵土。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克麗斯騰",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "它們是否知曉“宇宙”的存在？又是否會，成為我們的敵人或睦鄰？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克麗斯騰",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克麗斯騰",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果可以，或許每一個人都應該嘗試從這個位置，去瞭解“我們”，瞭解我們賴以生存的土地、天空和海洋......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克麗斯騰",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "瞭解自己身處人類歷史的什麼位置，而整個人類的歷史，又處在宇宙的什麼位置。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克麗斯騰",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "由此，我們才有資格思考，自己該往何處去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電子音",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "維生休眠艙將於一分鐘後啟動，請立即就位。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電子音",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "重複：維生休眠艙將於一分鐘後啟動，請立即就位。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克麗斯騰",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "休眠前記錄：生命體征正常；情緒相對穩定......艙室內的這些花草竟然還活著，真令人欣喜。可惜繆爾賽思已經無法拿到它們的資料。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克麗斯騰",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "克麗斯騰的一生中，僅有兩次真正感覺自己活著。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克麗斯騰",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "第一次，塞雷婭，是我帶你回到我的家鄉，在那個山坡上，向你講述一切的開始。第二次，是現在，我已然完成自己和父母的夢想。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克麗斯騰",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "之後發生的種種，都不過是最初的延續。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克麗斯騰",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "晴朗的夜晚，找一個視野開闊的地方架起望遠鏡吧，天空中會有一顆星星為你而閃爍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克麗斯騰",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
